    "terrainName": "test-town",
    "description": "What: Three civilians on open ground with no enterable building nearby, 20-30 m from a Rifleman who is firing at a Hostile (CV-7 fallback). Demonstrates that with no shelter within reach a frightened civilian cowers in place. Judge: (1) all three start in Routine, then under fire each enters Cower, EffectState.Cowering is set on CGF, SimHost and IG, and each stands still (under 0.3 m moved in 1.5 s) (2) once the firing is over, each leaves Cower as his fear fades and Cowering is cleared on every node. Fail: one runs off or never cowers, or stays cowering after the fire ends. Check: python3 scripts/utility-demo-check.py --launch ua-civ-cower"
  },
